<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16750" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσῡλ-ία</span></b> 
		ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>inviolability,</i> i.e., </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<i>safety to the person,</i> of suppliants, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. βροτῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					610
				</span></i>
			; of competitors at games, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Arat.</u>
				28
			</span></i>; in Inscrr., as a privilege bestowed on one who has deserved
			well of the state, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἶμεν δὲ αὐτῷ ἀτέλειαν καὶ ἀ. καὶ
					κατὰ γᾶν καὶ κατὰ θάλασσαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					7.11
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Megara</span>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				2.551.80
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				5(1).1226
			</span></i> (
				Lacon.
			), etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>sanctity, inviolability</i> of character, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἱερέως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					11.25
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> of a place of
			refuge, <i>right of sanctuary,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				4.74.2
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσυλίαν παρέχειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.828d
				</span></i>
			; freq. in Inscrr., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. πόλεως καὶ χώρας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					12(5).1341
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Paros</span>), etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>exemption from contributions,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.250
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
